Node ID=100 traveler
Text=There is not much trade here in Montaillou. You should know that this town is under investigation for heresy and the villagers are a strange and suspicious lot. You would be wise to leave this place. If you do enter town, abide the laws and stay out of trouble.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Why is this town under investigation?
Go to node ID=100 heresy

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I won't stay long. Farewell.
Go to node ID=100 goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 goodbye
Text=Remember, stay out of trouble. The Knights will not abide any disturbances from travelers.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 heresy
Text=Cathars. The village has been full of them for a generation, and the Inquisition has come to write down who. That is all it is: a man with a book, asking questions, and every soul in Montaillou answering him one at a time. Whether that ends in penances or in fire is not for me to say. Keep out of it.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will. Farewell.
Go to node ID=100 goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 relics
Text=Relics? Then you are on the Order's business whether you wear the cross or not, and you had best speak to the Inquisitor before you go digging. The Templars hold what is worth holding in this region, and we did not carry it up here to have it prised out of the ground by a stranger.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Understood. Who commands here?
Go to node ID=100 goodbye

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will keep that in mind.
Go to node ID=100 goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 horde
Text=<His hand does not leave the hilt.> The goblins. We have had word of what the Horde did at the Crossroads, and now one of them walks up the road to a Templar house and says so to my face. I will not draw on the Scion of Lionheart in the open street. But you will be watched every hour you are in Montaillou, and if a single villager comes to harm I will know exactly whose door to break.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Watch away.
Go to node ID=100 goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=The Horde and I are not the same thing.
Go to node ID=100 traveler
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 relics inquisition
Text=Forgive me Inquisitor, I meant no disrespect. Our duties here have been difficult of late. The populace of Montaillou harbors dark secerts, and the very creatures of this forest violently oppose us.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 relics knights female
Text=Forgive me sister, I meant no disrespect.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 relics knights male
Text=Forgive me brother, I meant no disrespect.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 relics saladin
Text=A Knight of Saladin? You don't have the look of a saracen, but if you serve that order, then you are an ally of the Templars - and thus welcome here.
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 knight banter 1
Text=What kind of host are you, Pierre? I am *starving*! Surely the mayor has more food?
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 knight banter 2
Text=Why don't you roast one of those delicious chickens you have outside?
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 knight banter 3
Text=My hunger is quickly outpacing my patience. Bring more food, Pierre. You know the code...
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=100 knight banter 4
Text=Bring more food! And more ale!
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
